Colosseum Field is a field effect exclusive to Rejuvenation. It is categorized as a Synthetic field and can be found in the [[The Underground]] Colosseum.

==General Effects==

* Switching Pokémon is done in attacking order instead of the Start of the turn. As such, faster attackers will attack before the switch is carried out. Shift-Mode is disabled.
* Any effect that forces its opposing target to switch will fail. Other effects of the same move still apply.
* Knocking out a Pokémon boosts one of the user's stats based on the highest stat of the KO'd opponent.

==Abilities Affected==

* Battle Armor and Shell Armor additionally boost the bearer's Defense by 1 stage on switch-in.
** ''[Pokémon]'s shining armor boosted its Defense!''
* Competitive additionally boosts the bearer's Special Defense by 2 stages on activation.
* Dauntless Shield additionally boost the bearer's Defense and Special Defense by 1 stage on switch-in.
** ''[Pokémon]'s shining armor boosted its Defense! [Pokémon]'s magical power boosted its Special Defense!''
* Defiant additionally boosts the bearer's Defense by 2 stages on activation.
* Emergency Exit boosts the bearer's Speed by 2 stages on activation instead of switching the bearer out.
* Intrepid Sword, Justified and No Guard additionally boost the bearer's Attack and Special Attack by 1 stage on switch-in.
** ''[Pokémon]'s ferocious heart boosted its Attack! [Pokémon]'s ferocious heart boosted its Special Attack!''
* Magic Guard and Mirror Armor additionally boost the bearer's Special Defense by 1 stage on switch-in.
** ''[Pokémon]'s magical power boosted its Special Defense!''
* Mimicry changes the user's type to Steel.
* Quick Draw causes the bearer's attack to be a critical hit when activated.
* Rattled and Wimp Out cause attacks against the bearer to always be critical hits.
* Skill Link additionally boosts multi-hit moves by 1.2x.
* Stalwart additionally gives the bearer the effect of Sturdy.
** ''[Pokémon] hung on with Stalwart in the Colosseum!''
* Wonder Guard additionally protects the bearer against indirect damage.

